  "details": "So I know the fact that blocking people will make them invisible but wanna point out that its going to be very hard to play games like \"Murder 4\"  and the other ones. SO! what I suggest is that there should be a \"🚫\" next to their nameplate in red (including the text) saying \"(Name of user) has blocked you\" when this person has blocked you, \"You blocked (Name of user)\" when you block that person and \"You and (Name of user) have each other blocked\" when both you and that person have each other blocked. And if thats the case then their avatar will look like the same thing when you turn off their avatar but the icon on the chest will be red instead of white. (edited)\n\nReact to Post\n\nFollowing\n\nNEW",
